{
  "id": "ALAS2023-2026-3449",
  "title": "Amazon Linux 2023 - ALAS2023-2026-3449: Important priority package update for rsyslog",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2026-11-12 09:00:00"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2026-11-12 09:00:00"
  },
  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2023 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2026-93404:\n\tAn SQL injection issue affects rsyslog deployments using the optional omclickhouse output module. Its built-in INSERT template used escaping that did not account for ClickHouse backslash escapes. A sender able to submit a log message routed to this action could alter the SQL sent to ClickHouse, potentially forging stored log records or evaluating expressions with the configured ClickHouse accounts privileges.\n",
